jet budget — Check performance limits or update baselines

  jet budget [args]
  --json                       Emit machine-readable facts or diagnostics
  --quiet                      Suppress non-error status output
  --color                      Color: auto | always | never
  --annotations                CI annotations auto, none, or github
  --baseline                   Selected baseline name
  --bootstrap                  Create absent or stale baseline history
  --accept-regression          Explicitly accept a regression
  --reason                     Checked-in reason
  --yes                        Apply a valid non-interactive plan
